  <h2>Quick Comparison</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Budget travelers:</strong> Hongdae or Myeongdong (most hostels and budget hotels)</li>
    <li><strong>Mid-range:</strong> Insadong, Itaewon, or Myeongdong</li>
    <li><strong>Luxury:</strong> Gangnam, Cheongdam, or Jongno (near palaces)</li>
    <li><strong>Airport convenience:</strong> Hongdae (direct AREX to Incheon, 30 min)</li>
  </ul>
